---
title: Ways to Contact | Pepper Farm Deli
description: Visit our social media from for Pepper Farm Deli, located in San Diego.
layout: "base.njk"
---

<div class="container max-w-screen-xl mx-auto mb-18 px-2 lg:px-0">
    <div class="flex flex-col">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold my-8 text-center deli-grad-text uppercase">Our Links</h1>
        <p class="mb-8 text-center">
            Check out the different ways to connect with us.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-4">
        {% for link in home.socialMedia %}
            <a class="text-3xl font-bold bg-lime-500 py-4 px-8 rounded-lg shadow-md" href="{{ link.fields.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ link.fields.name }}</a>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</div>